msgid "OpenMV for Optical Flow"
msgstr "OpenMV 光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:9
#: e896f65ef3a5466d99f689c1a86e7ed8
msgid ""
"The `OpenMV camera <https://openmv.io/>`__ is a programmable camera which "
"includes support for optical flow."
msgstr "`OpenMV 摄像头 <https://openmv.io/>`__ 是一款可编程摄像头，支持光流功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:15
#: 60333f3825ba4cd8a8320a5d8d2b9204
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:17
#: 99f14f17bbff4924bd99b2d618d04ce7
msgid ""
"The sensor can be purchased directly from `openmv.io "
"<https://openmv.io/collections/cams>`__"
msgstr "传感器可直接从 `openmv.io <https://openmv.io/collections/cams>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:20
#: d04ce57484b544b2acb7756adb6eaf30
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:26
#: a68c6d666ffa4ab7bbbacde68bfe5eb8
msgid ""
"The camera should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the camera "
"lens pointing downwards.  The camera edge with the lens should be towards "
"the front of the vehicle.  The image above is incorrect because the "
"autopilot's arrow is pointing down while the sensor's lens is close to the "
"top"
msgstr "摄像头应安装在多旋翼底部，镜头朝下。摄像头有镜头的边缘应朝向飞行器前方。上图不正确，因为飞控箭头朝下而传感器镜头靠近顶部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:27
#: 3bc8713565cb474e85caed60fed3314e
msgid ""
"Connect the camera's P4, VIN and GND pins to one of the autopilot's serial "
"ports as shown above.  In the image above the sensor is connected to a "
"Pixhawk's Telem2 port"
msgstr "按上图所示，将摄像头的 P4、VIN 和 GND 引脚连接到飞控的一个串口。上图中传感器连接到 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:28
#: 0af9d144c3814e2a980417359404d2f2
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` 设置为 5（MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:29
#: 44fb17cba8b3474c9ec63a3ddeb88bc1
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink) if using "
"Serial2/Telem2, if connected to another serial port use the corresponding "
"SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter"
msgstr ""
"若使用 Serial2/Telem2，将 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 "
"1（MAVLink）；若连接到其他串口，使用相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:30
#: 8a72bfa42a2241e2ba55e288b1e2cb69
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:34
#: b663fb0cde4242429e772c81fd3145bd
msgid ""
"Official pinout for the camera can be found `here "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0803/9211/files/cam-v3-pinout.png?6147773140464094715>`__"
msgstr ""
"摄像头的官方引脚图可在 `此处 "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0803/9211/files/cam-v3-pinout.png?6147773140464094715>`__"
" 找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:37
