msgstr "摄像头设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:39
#: 4614d11f3876499c8ed8e18e3e2a1705
msgid ""
"Official setup information can be found `here "
"<http://docs.openmv.io/openmvcam/tutorial/index.html>`__ but the short form "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"官方设置说明可在 `此处 <http://docs.openmv.io/openmvcam/tutorial/index.html>`__ "
"找到，简要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:41
#: 978830d50a684933864e178d979797e5
msgid ""
"Connect the OpenMV camera to your computer.  On Windows the camera should "
"appear as a new COM port and a virtual drive should also be created (this is"
" where scripts are copied to below)"
msgstr "将 OpenMV 摄像头连接到计算机。在 Windows 上，摄像头应显示为新的 COM 端口，并创建一个虚拟驱动器（脚本就复制到这里）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:42
#: 930b0ac52c8b459191e314ca4cac8160
msgid ""
"`Download, install and run the OpenMV IDE "
"<https://openmv.io/pages/download/>`__"
msgstr "`下载、安装并运行 OpenMV IDE <https://openmv.io/pages/download/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:43
#: e088e60316d647b0b4a6cb971ed923bb
msgid "Select File, Examples, 18-MAVLink, mavlink_opticalflow.py"
msgstr "选择文件、示例、18-MAVLink、mavlink_opticalflow.py"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:44
#: 8beabefae9ce40d8acf87533f893155c
msgid ""
"On the bottom right, select the Drive that corresponds to the OpenMV "
"camera's virtual drive"
msgstr "在右下角，选择对应 OpenMV 摄像头虚拟驱动器的驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:45
#: c2d1a94beb26438b88394535f1ff3e51
msgid "Select Tools, save open script to OpenMV Cam"
msgstr "选择工具，将当前脚本保存到 OpenMV Cam"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:46
#: b52e4c48fd5d44b185459338b367b1b9
msgid "Select Tools, Reset OpenMV Cam"
msgstr "选择工具，重置 OpenMV Cam"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:47
#: 372ce36af1ff498d93d30892deea66f2
msgid ""
"A green light on the camera should begin flashing which shows the script is "
"running"
msgstr "摄像头上的绿色灯应开始闪烁，表示脚本正在运行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:54
#: e0189ef42deb4f67b9bb06bbfd59a1f5
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:56
#: df717200a95d4c789799dcd474aa0367
msgid ""
"As with the :ref:`PX4Flow sensor <common-px4flow-overview>` a range finder "
"is required to use the sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>` and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`PX4Flow 传感器 <common-px4flow-overview>` 一样，在 Loiter 和 RTL "
"等自主模式中使用该传感器需要配备测距仪（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:57
#: 76c47292d9f4478ab694259ef8dc6427
msgid ""
":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` does not require the use of a rangefinder"
msgstr ":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` 模式无需使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:58
#: eabc7be9c0214debad5a7dffbddd06c7
msgid "The sensor has been successfully tested to altitudes of about 10m"
msgstr "该传感器已成功在约 10m 高度以下测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:59
#: deb2a8228d374ed3a3dfe7dc75c1d527
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:62
#: bf7f8bac45184ade8803df59fca1024a
msgid "Testing and Setup"
msgstr "测试与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:64
#: 4cc1edf5a00d463690c5c1d70c7018c4
msgid "See :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup` for setup guides."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup` 了解设置指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:65
#: 16e79eeaf10548e6b808e4ce0d5bb0ea
msgid ""
"Note that recommended value for :ref:`EK2_FLOW_DELAY <EK2_FLOW_DELAY>` or "
":ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` for this sensor is 80."
msgstr ""
"请注意，此传感器 :ref:`EK2_FLOW_DELAY <EK2_FLOW_DELAY>` 或 :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY "
"<EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` 的推荐值为 80。"
